          <p class="font-arabic text-2xl text-brand-gold-light" dir="rtl">المَدِينَة المُنَوَّرَة</p>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-ivory/85 leading-relaxed">
            The illuminated sanctuary where tranquility embraces every visitor. Present your greetings of Salaam at the noble resting place of the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him), pray in the Garden of Paradise (Rawdah Shareef), and reflect among the umbrellas of the Prophet's Mosque.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-brand-ivory/80">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-gold">✓</span> Masjid an-Nabawi & The Sacred Green Dome
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-gold">✓</span> Masjid Quba (The First Mosque in Islam)
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-gold">✓</span> Mount Uhud & The Memorial of the Martyrs
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <a
              href="/iconic-travel-tours/destinations/madinah/"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-brand-gold text-brand-emerald hover:brightness-110 transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              <span>Explore Madinah Guide</span>
              <span>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- SECTION 6: THE ICONIC JOURNEY (6-Step Visual Timeline) -->
