          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-sm relative space-y-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-brand-gold">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">Request Your Package</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal-muted leading-relaxed">
            Receive a formal transparent quotation, complete visa processing guidance, and guaranteed hotel vouchers vetted under GL #5247.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-sm relative space-y-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-brand-gold">04</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">Prepare for Departure</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal-muted leading-relaxed">
            Attend our pre-departure orientation, receive your pilgrim pack, synchronize your Nusuk Rawdah permit, and meet your group leader.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-sm relative space-y-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-brand-gold">05</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">Experience Your Journey</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal-muted leading-relaxed">
